  <div class="about-text">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm Anil Kumar, a Senior Android &amp; Flutter Developer
      with 6+ years of experience designing, building, and
      scaling production-grade mobile applications.
    </p>

    <p>
      My core expertise lies in Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Clean
      Architecture, and MVVM. I have built Android apps from
      scratch, maintained and evolved live production apps, improved
      performance on low-end devices, and contributed to products
      with 100K+ downloads.
    </p>

    <p>
      Alongside native Android, I have hands-on experience with
      Flutter and Dart, Kotlin Multiplatform, and Compose
      Multiplatform. I'm also passionate about AI integration,
      including building features with the Google Gemini API
      and exploring on-device AI.
    </p>

    <p>
      I've worked across ed-tech, payments, and content-streaming
      domains, collaborating closely with cross-functional teams to
      deliver reliable, scalable, and user-friendly products.
      I enjoy learning new technologies and turning ideas
      into meaningful digital experiences.
    </p>

